    "punchline": "Improves strafing under legacy movement controls",
    "tags": "",
    "website_text": " # SmartStrafe\n\n![release status](https://github.com/lichie567/SmartStrafe/actions/workflows/release.yml/badge.svg)\n![build status](https://github.com/lichie567/SmartStrafe/actions/workflows/build-debug.yml/badge.svg?branch=main)\n\nThis plugin improves strafing when backpedaling with legacy movement controls.\nCode for this plugin was borrowed from the SmartStrafe tweak in the SimpleTweaks plugin, authored by Iryoku. I created this plugin because I don't want to have to wait for all of SimpleTweaks to be updated on patch days.\n\nCode for the original tweak can be found here: https://github.com/Caraxi/SimpleTweaksPlugin\n\n## How to Install\n\nSmartStrafe is not available in the standard Dalamud plugin repository and must be installed from my third party repository.\n\nHere is the URL for my plugin repository: `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lichie567/SmartStrafe/main/repo.json`"
  },
